On the day Akari and I were to meet,
the rain turned to snow in the afternoon.

06:54.060 --> 06:55.440
Hey, Takaki.

06:55.600 --> 06:57.480
It's that cat, Chobi.

06:57.690 --> 06:59.860
He's always lying here.

