It must be lonely all by yourself, huh?

07:16.920 --> 07:17.880
How's that book so far?

07:17.880 --> 07:19.170
I really like it.

07:19.170 --> 07:21.670
Last night I read four billion years' worth of evolution.

07:21.670 --> 07:22.550
Where are you at now?

07:22.550 --> 07:24.550
Just about when the Anomalocaris start showing up.

07:24.550 --> 07:25.550
The Cambrian era!

07:27.050 --> 07:30.850
I really like the Hallucigenia. They look like this!

07:30.850 --> 07:32.180
Yeah, something like that...

07:32.180 --> 07:33.810
Which one do you like, Takaki?

07:33.890 --> 07:35.560
The Opabinia, maybe?

07:35.560 --> 07:37.650
The five-eyed one, right?

07:37.650 --> 07:41.820
I think Akari and I were a lot alike somehow.

07:43.110 --> 07:46.030
Takaki Tohno

07:43.440 --> 07:46.030
