m 0 0 l 2 15 3 15 2 0

37:16.340 --> 37:17.340
Wow...

37:18.670 --> 37:20.510
They say it travels at five kilometers per hour.

37:22.300 --> 37:24.470
It's going to the Minamitane launch facility.

37:25.720 --> 37:28.810
Looks like there'll be a launch this year. First time in a while.

37:28.810 --> 37:32.400
Yeah. It's supposed to go to 
the far reaches of the solar system.

37:32.400 --> 37:34.060
No matter how many years it takes...

37:53.290 --> 37:57.250
Hey... you should really talk to Kanae 
about her plans for the future.

37:57.250 --> 37:59.090
You know how absent-minded she can be.

37:59.090 --> 38:02.470
She'll be fine. It's not like she's a child anymore.

38:06.350 --> 38:08.470
I remember when I used to be just like that, a long time ago...

38:10.350 --> 38:14.520
Hear that, Kabu? Tohno apparently doesn't
know what tomorrow will bring, either.

38:14.520 --> 38:16.980
We're both the same. Tohno and me.{He's just like me is a funny edit but I will pass - Arid}

38:18.110 --> 38:20.240
It must really be...

38:20.950 --> 38:24.410
...a lonelier journey than anyone could imagine.

38:25.410 --> 38:28.870
To just press forward through the true pitch darkness...

38:28.870 --> 38:32.000
Barely encountering even a single hydrogen atom...

38:33.210 --> 38:35.830
Wholeheartedly believing you'll come closer to discovering...

38:35.830 --> 38:39.050
...the secrets of the universe 
within the unfathomable abyss of space.

38:44.090 --> 38:47.550
I wonder how far we should go...

38:48.350 --> 38:50.680
How far can we go?

